{"work_id":"manohara","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/manohara/scenes/scene-021.md","records":[{"id":"manohara-s021-d001","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"தோழி 1","speaker_delimiter":".","text":"உம்...போரிலே ஏற்பட்ட களைப்பு - புது மனைவியுடன் களிப்பு - எப்படியம்மா சீக்கிரம் வருவார்...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":33,"printed_page":32}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d002","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எனக்கு விஜயாவைக் காண வேண்டுமென்று ஆசை துடிக்கிறதடி!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":33,"printed_page":32}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d003","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"தோழி 2","speaker_delimiter":".","text":"அம்மா...யாரோ ஒரு துறவி, உங்களைப் பார்க்க வேண்டுமாம், அவசரமாக!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":33,"printed_page":32}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d004","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வணக்கம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d005","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"துறவி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வாழிய நலம்...மகாராணி...முதலில் இருதயத்தை இரும்பாக்கிக் கொள்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d006","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d007","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"துறவி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கரும்பல்ல நான் கழறப்போகும் செய்தி! உம்... கடலில் துரும்பம்மா மனித வாழ்க்கை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d008","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன சாமி; தொடர்பில்லாமல் பேசுகிறீர்கள்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d009","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"துறவி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தொடர்பற்றவன்தானே துறவி!...\nஉன் மகன் வெற்றியடைந்த செய்திகேட்டு எவ்வளவு மகிழ்ந்திருப்பாய்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d010","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம் ஸ்வாமி!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d011","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"துறவி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சந்தோஷத்தை அணைத்துக் கொள்ளும் அதே உள்ளம், சங்கடத்தை ஏன் சந்திக்க மறுக்கிறது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d012","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஸ்வாமி...என்ன நேர்ந்தது...சொல்லுங்கள்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d013","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"துறவி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இதோ...இந்தப் போர்வாள் சொல்லும்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d014","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d015","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"துறவி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"போய் விட்டான் உன் புதல்வன்...புண்ணியலோகத்துக்கு!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d016","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ...மனோகரா!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d017","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"மனோகரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏனம்மா இப்படிப் பார்க்கிறீர்கள்...என்ன நடந்தது...? யார் இந்த சாமியார்?...\n(கையிலுள்ள போர்வாளைக் கண்டு)\nஆ...என் போர்வாள்...காணாமற் போனது...எப்படி இங்கே வந்தது...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33},{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md","page_segments":[{"pdf_page":34,"printed_page":33,"text":"ஏனம்மா இப்படிப் பார்க்கிறீர்கள்...என்ன நடந்தது...? யார் இந்த சாமியார்?...\n(கையிலுள்ள போர்வாளைக் கண்டு)"},{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34,"text":"ஆ...என் போர்வாள்...காணாமற் போனது...எப்படி இங்கே வந்தது...?"}]},{"id":"manohara-s021-d018","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மனோகரா! நீ என்னைப் பிரிந்துவிட்டதாக இந்தப் பாவி சொன்னான்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d019","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"ராஜப்பிரியன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"திருட்டுப் பயல்!...வாளைத் திருடியதுமல்லாமல்...வாலை வேறு நீட்டுகிறானோ. தாடியைப் பார், தாடியை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d020","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"மனோகரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பெளத்தாயனன்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d021","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"ராஜ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சதியிலே புது அத்யாயம் - போர்வாளை திருடி வந்து காட்டினால்... மகாராணி இறந்துவிடுவார்கள். சரியான சூழ்ச்சி...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d022","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"மனோகரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தேளின் கொடுக்கே!...யாருடைய திட்டமடா இது!...சொல்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d023","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மனோகரா, பாவம்...அவனை விட்டுவிடு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d024","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"மனோகரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"விடக் கூடாதம்மா...ராஜப்ரியா...இவனை சிறையிலே பூட்டி வை!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d025","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பெளத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எல்லாவற்றுக்கும் வசந்தசேனை தான் காரணம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d026","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"மனோகரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வசந்தசேனை! இனியும் அவள் உயிரோடு விடக்கூடாது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d027","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மனோகரா! நில் - எங்கே ஓடுகிறாய்?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d028","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"மனோகரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மா இன்னும் என்ன - உங்கள் சபதத்தை நிறைவேற்றி விட்டபிறகு!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d029","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சொல்கிறேன், முதலில் “வாளை உறையில் போடு!...மகாராஜாவுக்கோ வசந்தசேனைக்கோ - என் அனுமதியின்றி, எந்தவிதமான தீங்கும் செய்வதில்லையென்று ஆணையிடு!...என்மேல் ஆணையிடு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d030","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d031","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தாயின்மேல் ஆணையிடு!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d032","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அரசரை ஒன்றும் செய்வதில்லையம்மா.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d033","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கூடாது! வசந்தசேனைக்கும் சேர்த்துத்தான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d034","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வசந்தசேனை...வட்டமிடும் கழுகு!...வாய் பிளந்து நிற்கும் ஓநாய்!...நம்மை வளைத்துவிட்ட மலைப்பாம்பு அவளுக்கு இரக்கம் - ??? முடியாது! கூடாது!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d035","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உன்னிஷ்டம்...ஊரார் நகைக்கட்டும் தாய் சொற் கேளாத தனயனென்று!...நாடு சிரிக்கட்டும் - அடங்காத மகனைப்பெற்ற அன்னையென்று!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d036","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யோ... அப்படியொன்றுமில்லையம்மா... இதோ ஆணையிட்டு விடுகிறேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"manohara-s021-d037","scene_id":"manohara-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"பத்மா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"செல்வா!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"}],"record_count":37}